direction: right
Client: Client {shape: person}
Commands: Command API {shape: rectangle}
Domain: Domain model {shape: rectangle}
EventStore: Event store {shape: cylinder}
Projector: Projection workers {shape: rectangle}
ReadDB: Read model {shape: stored_data}
Queries: Query API {shape: rectangle}
Client -> Commands: writes
Commands -> Domain: validate
Domain -> EventStore: append events
EventStore -> Projector: event stream
Projector -> ReadDB: update views
Client -> Queries: reads
Queries -> ReadDB
